  "changelog": "**Major update: Added inject/conversion workflows, semantic routing, and strict workflow enforcement.**\n\n- Added inject mode (`scripts/component_inject.py`) for safe incremental insertion of components into existing .tex files (LuaLaTeX/XeLaTeX/pdfLaTeX supported).\n- Added convert mode (`scripts/convert.py`) to transform complete pdfLaTeX documents to LuaLaTeX-compatible syntax, with conversion reports.\n- Introduced semantic workflow router (`scripts/workflow_router.py`) and state guard (`scripts/workflow_state.py`), strictly enforcing four main processing lines and protocol-based step verification.\n- Implemented large file handling hooks: size-based execution limits and suggestions for block processing.\n- Expanded script set: workflow report generator, write guards, improved safe write/delete tools.\n- Updated documentation and internal references for all new workflows, protocols, and compatibility features.",
